#Let the helper speak!
data modify entity @n[tag=helper] data.queue set value ["Alright!","First off, I've you've ever played Mario Party, this game should be very similar.","It's not the same entirely though, details differ a little.","The goal of the game is to collect as many \u00a7bDiamonds™\u00a7r as possible.","You can buy these when you pass them on the board.","At the end there will also be \u00a7bBonus Diamonds™\u00a7r, for those who excel in particular parts of gameplay.","Diamonds and items are bought using \u00a76gold\u00a7r, which is shown on the right side of the screen.","As you might have noticed, you already have \u00a7610\u00a7r, keep saving!","\u00a76Gold\u00a7r is mostly earned with minigames, the higher you score, the more you get.","That's the gist of it, you'll learn the details along the way.","If you ever need help with anything, just right-click me. If it's your turn, I'll follow you around.","Now, it's time to play some..."]
data modify entity @n[tag=helper] data.command set value "function mineparty:game/start/title_card"
function mineparty:game/helper/dialog/speak